<title>CANADA: Bombardier, Lufthansa in venture.</title>
<headline>Bombardier, Lufthansa in venture.</headline>
<dateline>MONTREAL 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bombardier Inc said on Wednesday it plans a partnership with Deutsche Lufthansa AG's Lufthansa Airlines to establish an executive air charter service for Europe.</p>
<p>The new joint venture, to be based at Berlin-Schonefeld Airport in Germany, will target European and North American corporate clients travelling to locations not easily accessible by regular scheduled airline service.</p>
<p>&quot;Customers will benefit from rapid response times, competitive hourly charter rates, and Lufthansa's recognized service,&quot; said Michael Graff, president of Bombardier's business aircraft division.</p>
<p>The new service will be operational next spring, Bombardier said.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Toronto (416) 941-8100</p>
</text>
